From: SBE1V1K build <noreply@example.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] ref_tunnel: include ref_tunnel.h so parse_tunnel() has a prototype

Same class as the ref_misc fix: ref_tunnel.c defines parse_tunnel()
(also called from ref_uci.c through ref_tunnel.h) but never includes
its own header, which trips -Wmissing-prototypes on 6.10+.

src/ref/ref_tunnel.c:272:5: error: no previous prototype for
  'parse_tunnel' [-Werror=missing-prototypes]

--- a/src/ref/ref_tunnel.c
+++ b/src/ref/ref_tunnel.c
@@ -12,6 +12,7 @@
 #include <linux/switch.h>
 #include "sw.h"
 #include "ref_uci.h"
+#include "ref_tunnel.h"

 static const char *tunnel_intf[] = {
 	"intf_id",
